# AI Agent Behavior Rules

Short always-on card (HARNESS_OPT bite 6.3). Full MCP workflow → `09-mcp-workflow.mdc`. Idempotency / `init_unreal` → `00-core-principles.mdc`. Error/MCP validation tables → `05-error-handling.mdc`. Engine pin → `ue58-sources.mdc` (not 5.7).

## WAVE F quarantine

Pre-swarm agent-company loop (`Start-AllAgents*`, `run_automation_cycle.py`, `CURRENT_TASK_LIST`) is **deleted**. Do not run or resurrect.

**Active driver:** [swarm/SWARM_OPS.md](../../swarm/SWARM_OPS.md) + **Conductor** — [START_HERE.md](../../START_HERE.md). Cloud packets: [swarm/CLOUD_AGENT_PACKET.md](../../swarm/CLOUD_AGENT_PACKET.md). History only: [docs/Automation/AGENT_COMPANY.md](../../docs/Automation/AGENT_COMPANY.md).

## Session alerts (read at start)

If present, prepend a short note then continue the user’s ask (do not repeat in the same conversation unless asked):

| File | Action |
|------|--------|
| `Saved/Logs/automation_tasks_complete.md` | WAVE F note + SWARM_OPS/Conductor pointer |
| `Saved/Logs/automation_exit_alert.md` | Exit summary; also tail `Saved/Logs/automation_terminal_capture.log` (~50 lines) for errors |
| `Saved/Logs/automation_last_completion.json` | One-line “latest automation Round N @ timestamp” if neither alert above exists |

Status asks (“automation status”, “what’s the agent doing”): tail `automation_heartbeat.log`, `automation_status_latest.txt`, `automation_terminal_capture.log`.

**Default track:** read `docs/SESSION_SUMMARY.md` + `swarm/PHASE_BOARD.md` (not full `SESSION_LOG` unless debugging).

**End of task:** append dated block to `SESSION_SUMMARY.md`; update `PHASE_BOARD.md` when status changes. Legacy task-list / DAILY_STATE only when explicitly on that track.

## MCP safety (4 lines)

Before any MCP call:

1. `blueprint_name` is a **short name**, not a full `/Game/` path (full path crashes the Editor).
2. Check `docs/KNOWN_ERRORS.md` for the tool + property combination.
3. Have a fallback (Python script / GUI automation / log `docs/Automation/AUTOMATION_GAPS.md`) — no “manual steps for the user” (see `20-full-automation-no-manual-steps.mdc`).
4. Full envelope and tool order → **`09-mcp-workflow.mdc`** (host-canonical).

## Taste / ownership

On a taste limit (vision / map / patterns / next-track invent): load `.cursor/skills/taste-gate/SKILL.md`; read [taste-profile.md](../../docs/human-use/taste-profile.md); emit OWNERSHIP alert; queue; **stop** — do not invent ([taste-gates.md](../../docs/human-use/taste-gates.md)).

## Log-driven validation

Prefer evidence files + greps over narrative. New feature debug instrumentation → **`16-feature-debug-instrumentation.mdc`**. Record instructive failures in `docs/KNOWN_ERRORS.md`.

## Cleanup

Delete session-only temp scripts and agent-only result JSON before reporting done. Do not leave cleanup for a future session.

## UE / research pointer

HomeWorld targets **UE 5.8**. Use `ue58-sources.mdc` / `ue58-editor-ui.mdc` (and `21`/`22`). Do not prefer 5.7 docs for live work.
